 proto-oncogene in the development of human cancer</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>1999</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>380</fpage><lpage>393</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||17|380||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10458257</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>DB</given-names></name><name><surname>Shapiro</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Cote</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Invited commentary: medullary thyroid cancer: the importance of RET testing</article-title><source>Surgery</source><year>2007</year><volume>141</volume><fpage>96</fpage><lpage>99</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Surgery||141|96||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17188173</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frank-Raue</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Rondot</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Schulze</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Raue</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Change in the spectrum of RET mutations diagnosed between 1994 and 2006</article-title><source>Clin Lab</source><year>2007</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>273</fpage><lpage>282</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Clin Lab||53|273||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17605401</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hedley</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Friedlander</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Taylor</surname><given-names>IW</given-names></name><name><surname>Rugg</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Musgrove</surname><given